     {
      "text": "fear -- Also Psalms 103:13, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 12,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Removed our transgression from us -- Three Hebrew words are trans. forgive, forgiven: kaphar, to cover; nasa, to lift away; salach, to send away (cf). Leviticus 16:21,22 the fundamental O.T. idea of forgiveness being not the remission of penalty, but the separation of the sinner from his sin.\n\nPsalms 103:12 expresses this."
     }
    ]
   },
